          "content": "The launch is real and fresh (2026-09-22, yesterday). Let me get the details from the primary source and key coverage, and find usable image URLs.\n\n\n[tool: exaScrape][tool: exaSearch]"
        },
        {
          "role": "tool",
          "content": "[tool-result: exaScrape][tool-result: exaSearch]"
        }
